OL,3,GNEWSAIce cream vans face licence
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FDog day care businesses and ice cream
OL,7,Fvans are among traders under scrutiny
OL,8,Fas enforcement officers crack down on
OL,9,Funlicensed activity in Worcester.
OL,11,FIntelligence is also being gathered on
OL,12,Fcafes, pubs and other businesses that
OL,13,Fplace tables and chairs on public
OL,14,Fpavements without the required
OL,15,Fpermission.
OL,17,FWorcester city councillor Richard Udall
OL,18,Fsaid he received "almost weekly emails"
OL,19,Fabout ice cream sellers operating
OL,20,Fwithout licences.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
