OL,3,GNEWSAIce cream vans face licence
OL,4,Acrackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The other one that concerns me
OL,7,Fgreatly, mostly because I use them, is
OL,8,Fdoggy day care centres," he told a
OL,9,Fmeeting of the council's licensing and
OL,10,Fenvironmental health committee. "There
OL,11,Fare so many being advertised and many
OL,12,Fare not licensed."
